## MVP Lifecycle

Each MVP is a fully deliverable increment of the desktop application. MVPs flow through:

```
Active (openspec/changes/mvp-X.Y/) → Completed (openspec/archive/mvp-X.Y/)
```

When all requirements in an MVP are `Done` and all tests pass:
1. Update the MVP row below to `Completed`
2. Move `openspec/changes/mvp-X.Y/` to `openspec/archive/mvp-X.Y/`

## Requirement ID Format

`REQ-{MVP}-{###}` where:
- `MVP` = milestone number (e.g. `1.0`, `1.1`, `2.0`)
- `###` = three-digit sequence within the MVP (e.g. `001`)

